Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,340] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 13 | Text: 想到什么 无论干什么 你先去做 好吧
Segment #2   [00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:04,200] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 你们永远在去等别人的建议
Segment #3   [00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,260] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 你看我这样合适不
Segment #4   [00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,200] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 你看我那样合适不 没用的
Segment #5   [00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,380] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 搞不到钱的
Segment #6   [00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,540] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 14 | Text: 你要问我 你别做了 你做你也做不下
Segment #7   [00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:15,600] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 其实大家要接受自己的普通
Segment #8   [00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,000] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 10 | Text: 如果自己并没有特别的大能力
Segment #9   [00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,760] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 一定要坚持到自己的平凡
Segment #10  [00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,300] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 不要想着去发大财
Segment #11  [00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,220] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 不要想着去羡慕别人的成果
Segment #12  [00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:23,860] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有用的
Segment #13  [00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,540] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 你只要能认清自己几斤几斤
Segment #14  [00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,800] | Elapsed:  13.78s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是你所有的痛苦会烟焦云散
Segment #15  [00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,180] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 5  | Text: 你看我们正常人
Segment #16  [00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,360] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们去做一件事情
Segment #17  [00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,060] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们怎么会去做呢
Segment #18  [00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,700] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 一定要有信息的来源
Segment #19  [00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:38,500] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 11 | Text: 你们回想一下你们之前所做的行业
Segment #20  [00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,780] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 它不可能是你自己在家里
Segment #21  [00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,680] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 突然之间灵光大线
Segment #22  [00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,840] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 我要去开个早餐店
Segment #23  [00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:44,820] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 6  | Text: 我要去做个工厂
Segment #24  [00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,280] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 一定不是这样的
Segment #25  [00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,000] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 11 | Text: 你要么你看你身边人做这个东西
Segment #26  [00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:48,580] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 赚到什么钱
Segment #27  [00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,380] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 9  | Text: 要么谁给你纸的条道
Segment #28  [00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:52,060] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 或者说你刷了短视频
Segment #29  [00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:54,180] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 11 | Text: 看到了谁干其他什么项目挺好
Segment #30  [00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,500] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 一定是这样的
Segment #31  [00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,360] | Elapsed:  28.72s | Words: 4  | Text: 你不知道做什么
Segment #32  [00:00:57,360 --> 00:01:00,440] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 是因为你没有信息的涉入来源
Segment #33  [00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:02,660] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 或者说你们很多人对于
Segment #34  [00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:04,540] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 创业信息的捕捉
Segment #35  [00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:05,500] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 它是错的
Segment #36  [00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,060] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 你们没有一个分辨能力
Segment #37  [00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:08,640] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 你们容易被别人牵着走
Segment #38  [00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:11,220] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 10 | Text: 今天别人告诉你做AI卖剧好
Segment #39  [00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:12,160] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就做AI卖剧了
Segment #40  [00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,800] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 10 | Text: 明天别人告诉你开餐厅好
Segment #41  [00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:14,900] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就去干餐厅了
Segment #42  [00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:15,740] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 3  | Text: 在后天
Segment #43  [00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:16,800] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 有人告诉你水果炼好
Segment #44  [00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:17,580] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就干水果炼了
Segment #45  [00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,120] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 其实这是不对的
Segment #46  [00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,140] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 所以说你还是要关事业
Segment #47  [00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:23,200] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 5  | Text: 天要关事业
Segment #48  [00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,120] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 才有事业过来
Segment #49  [00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,520] | Elapsed:  45.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 你说你天天从家呆着
Segment #50  [00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,780] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 大门不出
Segment #51  [00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:27,740] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 二门不卖的
Segment #52  [00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:29,540] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 12 | Text: 你天天在家里就拨了个手机
Segment #53  [00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:31,000] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 跟你这个胡同舟友
Segment #54  [00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,200] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 8  | Text: 喝喝啤酒打打麻净
Segment #55  [00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:34,320] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 8  | Text: 你上哪知道你能干什么
Segment #56  [00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,880] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 9  | Text: 我当年不在三通零一
Segment #57  [00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:37,920] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 一张火车票南下
Segment #58  [00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,320] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 我也不知道我干啥
Segment #59  [00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,460] | Elapsed:  56.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 路都是人走出来的
